@context: Data-driven from JSON — one pass per object, keys become {placeholders}.
@title: data_driven_cart
@tags: regression, data
@data: ../data/products.json

STEP 1: Buy {qty} x {product}
    NAVIGATE to {base_url}/catalog.html
    VERIFY that 'Loaded 3 products' is present
    REPEAT {qty} TIMES:
        CLICK the 'Add to cart' button NEAR '{product}'
    VERIFY that 'Cart: {qty}' is present

DONE.
